# infra/ is a build context for two images (db-roles, terraform runner) and also
# holds .terraform provider plugins (~540MB), tfstate and plan files. State and
# plan files contain secrets in plaintext and must never enter an image.
# Whitelist only what the images copy.
*
!db-roles.sql
!db-roles-entrypoint.sh
!run.sh
!*.tf
!*.tfvars
!backend-production.hcl
!backend-staging.hcl
